   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "如何保持卧室整洁",
     "text": "这里有一些轻松保持卧室整洁的好方法！从衣柜、搁架到床下储物等，这些创意和技巧有助你保持房间整洁宁静。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20241023/F0988737-4646-42C0-BEFBCBEF4034745B.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/how-to-declutter-your-bedroom-in-9-easy-steps-pub3676540e",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "帮助你挑选理想抽屉柜的好办法",
     "text": "你理想中的抽屉柜是什么样子？查看这四条建议，帮助你找到理想的卧室抽屉柜，在品味、生活方式及预算方面均满足你的需求。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20240926/8D32EC9C-7A8F-427D-B7B12AA143797C8E.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/4-ideas-to-guide-and-solve-your-chest-of-drawers-search-pubc91c761d",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何轻松地整理抽屉柜",
     "text": "渴望打造宁静有序的衣物收纳效果？了解如何整理抽屉柜——获得更加便捷实用的收纳体验。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20240926/7A650F1B-E51B-43C7-B070070E1450C28B.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/5-tidy-tips-how-to-organise-a-chest-of-drawers-pub3890afa3",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "找到你理想中的卧室顶灯",
     "text": "宜家产品系列包含众多耀眼的卧室顶灯。你可以从中挑选自己喜欢的吊灯、顶灯、射灯或枝形吊灯。立即选购。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20241023/191F4821-3901-402C-88648C867E988B1B.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/which-is-the-best-ceiling-light-to-choose-for-your-bedroom-pubd84e4238",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何让留宿的客人睡得更香",
     "text": "无论空间大小，你都可以通过很多简单方法，让留宿的客人睡得更舒适。一起来看看这些巧妙的小贴士和灵感吧！",
     "image": "https://content-service-oss.aidesign.ingka-internal.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/89d2d925-688c-43e2-9e5d-3b6866656f79.jpeg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/how-to-help-guests-sleep-longer-pub5b542923",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何打造舒适的床铺，让美梦成真",
     "text": "舒适的床铺因人而异，这完全取决于个人的喜好和选择。一起来了解各种分类，找到最适合你的床。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content-space/barn-images/0132EADF-BB20-4404-8897E3E2200E6AC0/main-v1.",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/how-to-create-a-cosy-bed-and-make-dreams-come-true-pub2acf148d",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "多功能房间的巧妙设计",
     "text": "为什么要将一个房间局限于一种用途？一个房间可以同时是家庭办公室、客房、书房或发挥更多功能。高效利用空间，发掘更多用途！",
     "image": "https://content-service-oss.aidesign.ingka-internal.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/da55f41f-a0dc-40ef-8864-92155cfef4da.jpeg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/proudly-presenting-guest-room-and-home-office-a-love-story-pub74cacbf0",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "轻松改善睡眠质量的六大关键",
     "text": "睡眠质量不仅仅取决于床本身，房间环境、温度、光线等方面也会有影响。现在就来了解如何改善你的睡眠质量！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content-space/barn-images/16D47004-C6E1-449D-B749B1A0845C0A8A/main-v1.",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/how-to-get-better-sleep-6-keys-to-quality-slumber-pub37fe9847",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何找到并保持理想睡眠温度",
     "text": "了解如何轻松解决夜间过热或过冷的问题，无需花费太多精力或金钱！只需改变床上的一处细节，问题便可迎刃而解。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/5fec100b-806f-4869-8285-aec122738c35.jpeg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/how-to-get-the-best-sleep-temperature-pub319a38ff",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "每天如何保持一整夜的凉爽感",
     "text": "很多人抱怨夜间太热，但你不必成为他们中的一员。这些简单的创意和智能产品可以助你保持凉爽。",
     "image": "https://content-service-oss.aidesign.ingka-internal.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/ce299905-dc89-46bd-b0fd-0e71817fccba.jpeg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bedroom/how-to/how-to-keep-cool-at-night-the-essentials-for-quality-sleep-pubdd92b04a",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何挑选适合你的被子",
